    12-. "<div>1. Register the editor tab<br />directly by ViewKey</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[IView events]</div>" .->9
    9-. "<div>2. Subscribe as this view's<br />dispatch owner</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->12
    1-. "<div>3. Invoke Save for the active<br />editor tab</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->4
    4-. "<div>4. Execute the shared Save<br />command for that tab</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[ICommand]</div>" .->5
    5-. "<div>5. Raise CommandRequested on<br />the editor tab with its<br />captured document ID</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[RelayCommand or AsyncRelayCommand]</div>" .->12
    12-. "<div>6. Deliver the request to the<br />controller the tab registered<br />with</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[IView events]</div>" .->9
    9-. "<div>7. Execute the typed Save<br />Document request through the<br />shared CQRS entry point</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->8
    8-. "<div>8. Invoke the registered Save<br />Document handler</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->10
    1-. "<div>9. Switch to another editor<br />tab while the save is pending</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->4
    10-. "<div>10. Stage the captured text</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->20
    20-. "<div>11. Wait to publish the<br />source file</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->19
    9-. "<div>12. Verify the original<br />registration and revision,<br />then commit</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->20
    20-. "<div>13. Replace the source with<br />the captured text</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->47
    9-. "<div>14. Queue synchronization for<br />the committed save</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->13
    9-. "<div>15. Schedule the correlated<br />outcome for the original<br />registration</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->23
    23-. "<div>16. Deliver the result to the<br />same editor tab if its<br />registration is live</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->12

